{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13740","headline":"行路难三首 一 · 顾况","name":"行路难三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见担雪塞井空用力，炊砂作饭岂堪食。\n一生肝胆向人尽，相识不如不相识。\n冬青树上挂凌霄，岁晏花凋树不凋。\n凡物各自有根本，种禾终不生荳苗。\n行路难，行路难，何处是平道。\n中心无事当富贵，今日看君颜色好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}